;; Gov-Atlas Ontology — canonical kotoba-EAVT vocabulary for the WORLD GOVERNMENT ATLAS
;; ADR-2606021600 (ooyake 公)  (depends-on ADR-2606011000 engi-organism-ontology,
;;   ADR-2605262130 kotoba substrate, ADR-2605312345 datom-first-class,
;;   ADR-2605242330 gov-procedure coverage taxonomy [SCOPE AMENDED here],
;;   ADR-2605212100 gov 5-layer taxonomy, ADR-2606013800 actor-profile dynamic did.json)
;;
;; PURPOSE: the canonical, content-addressed STRUCTURAL atlas of every government
;; unit on Earth — supranational → country → region/subdivision → prefecture →
;; municipality/ward → ministry → agency → bureau → division → section → 窓口 —
;; each carrying 住所 (address) / 窓口 (service window) / 書式 (form) / 手続き
;; (procedure) / BPMN. This is the READ-SIDE atlas that danjo (watch), kanae
;; (fiscal viz), tsumugi (power-graph), toritsugi (citizen concierge) and
;; himotoki (disclosure) all consume — the single SSoT for "who/where/how" of
;; public administration.
;;
;; FOUR distinctions from sibling ontologies:
;;   :gov.unit/*  the administrative node (recursive tree). A STRUCTURAL overlay,
;;                NOT the karma/縁 node — it links to :organism (engi) via
;;                :gov.unit/organism for the tsumugi power-graph, never duplicates it.
;;   :gov.address/* :gov.window/* :gov.form/* :gov.procedure/* :gov.bpmn/*
;;                the concrete service surface (住所/窓口/書式/手続き/BPMN), mirroring
;;                the :company.address/* / :company.contact/* style of
;;                public-company-ontology for cross-graph consistency.
;;
;; CONSTITUTIONAL (ADR-2606021600 §4):
;;   - OBSERVATIONAL MIRROR ONLY (G3): the per-unit atlas DID
;;     `did:web:etzhayyim.com:gov:<iso3>:...` is an etzhayyim civic-atlas MIRROR.
;;     It NEVER claims to BE the government, NEVER is an official channel, NEVER
;;     issues/accepts anything on a government's behalf (§2(c) impersonation ban).
;;   - PUBLIC-DATA-ONLY (G4): only public official sources; respect robots/ToS/
;;     rate-limits; no behind-auth access; no official's personal data beyond
;;     public role-contact (G6 data-minimization).
;;   - NON-FABRICATION (G5): every datom carries :*/provenance + :*/last-verified +
;;     :*/sourcing (:authoritative | :representative). :representative rows are
;;     illustrative and MUST NOT be counted as coverage.
;;   - CIVIC WAYFINDING, NEVER A TARGET-LIST (G10): like tsumugi/watatsuna — a map
;;     that helps a citizen FIND a service, never an attack-surface map of the state
;;     (Transparent Religious Force discipline, ADR-2605192100 §1.12).
;;
;; STATUS: proposed R0 scaffold. NOT executed — no cell runs and no real-world data
;; is ingested beyond the unverified-seed proof-of-model until Council Lv6+ ratifies
;; ADR-2606021600 and the §4 outbound gates are honored.

