  :db/doc "etzhayyim civic-atlas MIRROR DID: did:web:etzhayyim.com:gov:<iso3>[:<level>:<code>]... — OBSERVATIONAL only (G3); never claims to BE the gov, never an official channel"}
 {:db/ident :gov.unit/official-did
